<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>i create the superglide + strafing so you can make enemies confused with your movement
bind this key to C, V or Spacebar (but if you bind this to spacebar it may cause your gameplay) then also add aditional bind W to Mouse Scroll Wheel Up
to practice this macros make sure you are in the edge of obstacle then when you got perfect timing press this key
you can change D key to A if you want superglide strafing to the left
enjoy!
</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 7 1
Delay 4 ms
KeyUp 7 1
Delay 4 ms
KeyDown 44 1
Delay 4 ms
KeyUp 44 1
Delay 4 ms
KeyDown 6 1
Delay 10 ms
KeyUp 6 1
Delay 4 ms
WheelUp 1
Delay 4 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Apex Legends</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>